      "title": "MiniMax H3 Image · quality path",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## MiniMax H3 Image · quality path\n\n- **16 MP (4096×4096) is the default.** The model is tuned for roughly 16 MP and is noticeably sharper there than at 4 MP. Lower `megapixels` to 4 if the GPU runs out of memory.\n- **Prompt enhancer is ON by default.** A Qwen3.5-9B text model expands the short prompt into a production-ready caption; switch `Enable prompt enhancer` off to send the raw prompt unchanged.\n- The prompt enhancer is a text model. It is separate from the image model and from the Qwen3-VL image text encoder.\n- 6 steps, CFG 1, `euler` + `simple` is the reference recipe. Raise steps to 20–50 for more detail.\n- Use `ResolutionSelector` to change aspect ratio or megapixels. Keep dimensions on the 32-pixel grid.\n- The optional Qwen prompt-enhancer branch is the official quality path; the model itself is still the new MiniMax-H3-Image weights."
      ]
    },
